@baseUrl = http://localhost:4777

### Webhook - Cadastrar paciente como visitante com QR Code
### (startDate=agora, endDate=agora+VISITOR_ACCESS_HOURS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhook/patient
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Paciente Webhook",
  "type": "visitor"
}

###

### Webhook - Cadastrar visitante automaticamente
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhook/patient
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Visitante Webhook",
  "type": "visitor"
}

###

### Webhook - Cadastrar com cardNumber fixo (ex: ID externo do sistema)
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhook/patient
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PAC - FELIPE MORAES - 9999",
  "cardNumber": 1600148,
  "type": "visitor",
  "doc": "1600148"
}

###

### Health check do serviço
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
